.TH ec7wolf 6
.SH NAME
ec7wolf - Corridor 7: Alien Invasion source port

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ec7wolf
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIfiles\fR ...]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ec7wolf
is a sourceless source port of the 1994 Capstone FPS Corridor 7: Alien
Invasion, built on a fork of the ECWolf engine (itself derived from Wolf4SDL).
It reads the original Corridor 7 data files and reproduces the game's
rendering, weapons, enemies, and mission progression on a modern engine, with
modern control schemes, wide-screen support, and unlimited save slots.

.SH OPTIONS
Use the --help option for a complete list of options. To load a directory of
Corridor 7 data files directly, use
.BR "--data " \fIDIR\fR.

.SH FILES
The original Corridor 7 game data files are required for operation
(CORR7CD.EXE, MAPTEMP.CO7, GFXTILES.CO7, the VGAGRAPH family and the AUDIO
family). They may be placed in
.IR ~/.config/ec7wolf
or supplied with the
.B --data
option. No commercial game data is included with or redistributed by this port.

.SH BUGS
The bug tracker is located at https://github.com/jeddhor/EC7Wolf/issues
